      "changelog": "\u003ch3\u003eChanged\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eRewrote autocrafting again, bringing performance up to par with other autocrafting mods.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAutocrafting now reserves items and fluids in an internal inventory to avoid having the storage network steal stacks required for autocrafting.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eReworked the Crafting Monitor to be more condensed and more clear.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eFixed\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFixed not being able to craft upgrades that require enchanted books.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFixed quick jittering of the Grid and Crafting Monitor when opening them because the tabs appear.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eRemoved\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eRemoved left / right click functionality on filter slots to increase / decrease the amount, replaced that functionality with a dialog.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n",
